  <h2 class="mb-4">TaskPi - White Paper</h2>

  <h3>A Decentralized Microtask Ecosystem on the Pi Network</h3>
  <h4>Abstract</h4>
  <p>TaskPi introduces a decentralized, trust-driven platform where users complete simple tasks in exchange for Pi coins. With a tiered user system, human validators, and reputation-based access, TaskPi ensures fair participation and scalable validation.</p>

  <h4>Problem</h4>
  <ul>
    <li>Centralized microtask platforms often underpay and rely heavily on automation.</li>
    <li>Validation is either poor or costly.</li>
    <li>Users lack control and transparency.</li>
  </ul>

  <h4>Solution</h4>
  <ul>
    <li>A 3-tier user model (Beginner → Performer → Validator)</li>
    <li>Escrow-based rewards with human validation</li>
    <li>Transparent task lifecycle with proof submission and peer review</li>
  </ul>

  <h4>User Levels</h4>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Level 1:</strong> Auto-approved, simple tasks</li>
    <li><strong>Level 2:</strong> Requires proof and validation</li>
    <li><strong>Level 3:</strong> Trusted validators earn small rewards per review</li>
  </ul>

  <h4>Validation</h4>
  <ul>
    <li>Initially handled by admins</li>
    <li>Later transferred to high-accuracy users (Level 3)</li>
  </ul>

  <h4>Anti-Fraud</h4>
  <ul>
    <li>No AI automation</li>
    <li>History-based trust, validator accountability</li>
    <li>Cross-checking and banning of bad actors</li>
  </ul>

  <h4>Technology Stack</h4>
  <ul>
    <li>Node.js + Express</li>
    <li>Handlebars view engine (HBS)</li>
    <li>SQL or MongoDB database</li>
    <li>Admin panel for manual reviews</li>
  </ul>

  <h4>Roadmap</h4>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Phase 1:</strong> Launch with Level 1 tasks only</li>
    <li><strong>Phase 2:</strong> Introduce Level 2 and admin validation</li>
    <li><strong>Phase 3:</strong> Community-powered validation by Level 3 users</li>
    <li><strong>Phase 4:</strong> Integrate AI personalization engine to analyze user behavior and optimize task recommendations</li>
  </ul>

  <h4>Conclusion</h4>
  <p>With planned AI integration, TaskPi will ensure users receive tasks aligned with their behavior and interests. TaskPi empowers real users, enables trust at scale, and utilizes the Pi Network’s unique community to create an economy of micro-effort and mutual benefit.</p>